From f202014a14be2a8ba243bd38694ea3c0f22b824f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Donald Odera <donald@example.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 11:48:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Unify all three billing.html variants on one template

- All three files (public/, root, netlify-static/) now share identical
  markup and JS, differing only in the API_BASE constant used for fetches
- public/ and root: API_BASE = '' (relative, proxied by netlify.toml /
  served by Express on the same origin)
- netlify-static/: API_BASE points at its standalone backend since that
  deploy has no redirect proxy
- Carries forward the cold-start-tolerant retry logic from the previous
  commit to all three
---
